UnitCanonGuardRegistry::record
├── when the caller is not a signer
│   └── it reverts with NotSafeSigner
├── when the arrays have different lengths
│   └── it reverts with ArrayLengthMismatch
├── when a label is empty
│   └── it reverts with EmptyLabel
└── when executing the function
    ├── it adds the entity to the set
    ├── it stores the edition
    └── it emits EntityRecorded event

UnitCanonGuardRegistry::remove
├── when the caller is not a signer
│   └── it reverts with NotSafeSigner
├── when the entity is not found
│   └── it reverts with EntityNotFound
└── when executing the function
    ├── it removes the entity from the set
    ├── it clears the edition
    └── it emits EntityRemoved event

UnitCanonGuardRegistry::totalEntities
└── it returns the length of the set

UnitCanonGuardRegistry::read
├── when offset is greater than the total number of entities
│   └── it returns an empty array
└── when executing the function
    ├── when entities to return are less than the limit
    │   └── it returns the entities with their editions
    └── when entities to return are greater than the limit
        └── it returns the entities with their editions 

UnitCanonGuardRegistry::entityLabel
└── it returns the edition of the entity
